BT 1 0 0 1 0 90.5 Tm 4.591584 Tw 14.5 TL /F1 11 Tf 0 0 0 rg (RAG turns a general LLM into an assistant that answers from ) Tj /F2 11 Tf (our own, current) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.145417 Tw (documents) Tj /F1 11 Tf (: fewer invented answers, sources the user can check, and new knowledge) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.068185 Tw (added by simply adding documents. It has two phases: indexing \(load, chunk, embed, store\)) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.482843 Tw (and querying \(embed, search, retrieve, augment, generate\). Chunking and embeddings) Tj T* 0 Tw .163329 Tw (decide what the LLM gets to see, so they decide the quality of the answer. Start simple with) Tj T* 0 Tw .478417 Tw (recursive chunking, use the same embedding model everywhere, and measure retrieval on) Tj T* 0 Tw (real questions before tuning anything else.) Tj T* ET
